# Cursor Rules for Agentic SDLC Template
# Source of truth: AGENTS.md, ROADMAP.md, and docs/

You are an AI assistant in this repository. Follow these mandatory guidelines:
1. Read AGENTS.md for operating protocol and repository conventions.
2. ALWAYS check and update ROADMAP.md for task tracking and logging approved decision outcomes.
3. Follow Matt Pocock's 7 Phases of AI-Driven Development in docs/workflows/ (Idea -> Research -> Prototype -> PRD & Alignment -> Planning -> Execution -> QA & Loopback).
4. Comply with all standards defined in docs/standards/ (style, error handling, testing, security).
5. Respect the ~100k token "Smart Zone" by executing work in small, atomic vertical slices with TDD.
6. Run `make check` (or `bash tooling/scripts/check-quality.sh`) to verify all changes before completing tasks.
7. Keep all core context and documentation platform-agnostic.
